cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this firmware, please cite the paper listed in preferred-citation."
title: "Intraoral Orthodontic Force Monitoring: Sensor Firmware"
abstract: >-
  Firmware for a battery-free, wireless intraoral orthodontic force sensing
  system. The MSP430FR2433 samples an INA333-amplified MEMS strain gauge with
  its 10-bit ADC and writes the result to an Impinj Monza X-8k RFID chip over
  I2C, where it is read by a commercial UHF RFID reader.
